' SD-01. UC-001 전원 ON 중 일반 모드 청소 유지
' Related Use Case: UC-001. 전원 ON 중 일반 모드 청소 유지
' Intent: 먼지와 현재 진행 방향 장애물이 없을 때 일반 모드와 현재 진행 방향 주행 명령을 생성하는 흐름을 표현한다.

@startuml SD_01_UC001_Normal_Mode_Cleaning
hide footbox
title SD-01 - UC-001 전원 ON 중 일반 모드 청소 유지

actor "센서 입력" as Sensor
participant "RVC SW Controller" as Controller
participant "SensorState" as SensorState
participant "AutomaticCleaning" as Cleaning
participant "CleaningPolicy" as Policy
participant "CommandResult" as CommandResult
participant "CleaningCommand" as CleaningCommand
participant "MovementCommand" as MovementCommand
actor "청소 장치" as Cleaner
actor "주행 장치" as Drive

Sensor -> Controller: reportSensorSnapshot(dustDetected=false, currentDirectionObstacle=false)
activate Controller
Controller -> SensorState: updateSnapshot(frontObstacleDetected, backObstacleDetected, dustDetected=false)
Controller -> Cleaning: handleSensorSnapshot(SensorState)
activate Cleaning
Cleaning -> SensorState: isDustDetected()
SensorState --> Cleaning: false
Cleaning -> SensorState: obstacleDetectedIn(currentDirection)
SensorState --> Cleaning: false
Cleaning -> Policy: normalPowerLevel()
Policy --> Cleaning: NORMAL
Cleaning -> CleaningCommand: create(NORMAL)
CleaningCommand --> Cleaning: cleaningCommand

alt currentDirection = FORWARD
    Cleaning -> MovementCommand: create(MOVE_FORWARD)
else currentDirection = BACKWARD
    Cleaning -> MovementCommand: create(MOVE_BACKWARD)
end

MovementCommand --> Cleaning: movementCommand
Cleaning -> CommandResult: withCleaning(cleaningCommand)
Cleaning -> CommandResult: withMovement(movementCommand)
CommandResult --> Cleaning: commandResult
Cleaning --> Controller: commandResult
deactivate Cleaning

Controller -> Cleaner: setCleaningPower(NORMAL)
alt currentDirection = FORWARD
    Controller -> Drive: moveForward()
else currentDirection = BACKWARD
    Controller -> Drive: moveBackward()
end

deactivate Controller
@enduml
